useProj: one pass [thA], per reference [(thA, (some true)), (And.left, (some false))]
useLet: one pass [thA], per reference [(thA, (some true)), (And.right, (some false))]
useLetShadow: one pass [], per reference [(trivial, (some false)), (thA, (some false)), (And.left, (some false))]
useNested: one pass [thA], per reference [(thA, (some true)), (And.left, (some false))]
useMatch: one pass [], per reference [(thA, (some false))]
useCases: one pass [thA], per reference [(thA, (some true))]
useRec: one pass [useRec._proof_1], per reference [(useRec._proof_1, (some true))]
useNone: one pass [], per reference [(thA, (some false))]
useLetUnused: one pass [], per reference [(trivial, (some false)), (thA, (some false))]
deepLetProj: one pass [thA], per reference [(thA, (some true)), (And.left, (some false))]
deepLetPlain: one pass [], per reference [(thA, (some false))]
deepFunLet: one pass [thA], per reference [(thA, (some true)), (And.left, (some false))]
deepShared: one pass [thA], per reference [(thA, (some true)), (And.left, (some false))]
Init.Prelude: pairs compared 503 (13 value-sensitive), over budget 0, mismatches #[]
